* Pro Words
** BREAK (BT, =)
** ATSIGN
** I SPELL
** AMATEUR CALL
** MIXED GROUP
** FIGURE / FIGURES
** INITIAL / INITIALS
** X (period) (is this is prosign?)
** R (decimal point)
** QUERY (?)
** CORRECTIONS
** AFFIRMATIVE / NEGATIVE (yes / no)

* ICS Forms
** Radiogram Form

* Parts
** Preamble
*** Station of Origin - the ham who put it on the air - this is the station that will get service msgs back
*** Place of Origin is CITY STATE
*** Place of Origin matches signature (ie who wrote the msg)
*** Time Files assumes UTC, so don't bother with Z, otherwise specify
*** Date is MMM DD (NB UTC!)
** Address
*** FIRST LAST [CALLSIGN]
*** ADDRESS
*** CITY STATE ZIP
*** PHONE NUMBER ###-###-####
*** [email]
** [OP NOTE]
** Receiving Station info - rarely used
** ''BREAK''
** Text Body
** Signature
** Received / Sent Info

